{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902910/extras/082a3763256e6b843cd333688f58ea25.poster.avif?t=1766224808\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902910/extras/082a3763256e6b843cd333688f58ea25.webm?t=1766224808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902910/extras/082a3763256e6b843cd333688f58ea25.mp4?t=1766224808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the king\u2019s \u2014 for now \u2014 trusted advisor, your role is to judge those who appear before the royal tribunal. Condemn the innocent, spare the guilty, and steer the kingdom into chaos. But beware: the king watches you. Play your cunning game carefully\u2026 or  lose his favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Judge the Masses</i>.</strong> Each day, you\u2019ll evaluate a new person based on their relationships, worldviews, careers, or even childhood memories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Uncover the Truth</i>.</strong> Reveal hidden facts to understand their true nature, but be careful: some will lie and bribe to mislead you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Gain Favor</i>.</strong> Earn the king\u2019s trust to unlock powerful bonuses \u2014 or fall out of favor and face the harsh consequences.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902910/extras/bc78911725b6e443efe4f17924b2fdd2.poster.avif?t=1766224808\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902910/extras/bc78911725b6e443efe4f17924b2fdd2.webm?t=1766224808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902910/extras/bc78911725b6e443efe4f17924b2fdd2.mp4?t=1766224808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Paths to Power</i>.\u00a0</strong>Weave a web of lies to manipulate the king or recruit the accused into your secret cult, growing its influence. Each of the nine advisor types offers a unique path to chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Roguelike Judgement</i>.</strong>\u00a0Every run brings fresh trials and lasting rewards. Unlock new advisors, difficulty levels, and life facts for future runs as you drag the kingdom further into moral decay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Create and share.</i></strong> Build characters with unique backstories and bring them before the tribunal to be judged by other players or yourself.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3902910?t=1766224808","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902910/59c0640ed66c70617b07d61cd626f4483460d4f5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766224808","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902910/82af84ac3872cd604286358cbd794f6547c38fe6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766224808","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902910/82af84ac3872cd604286358cbd794f6547c38fe6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766224808","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Includes implied depictions of violence, such as execution scenes that do not show direct harm, and mentions of viole